    <string name="onboarding_title_1">Siyakwamukela ku-NaviTV Browser</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_1">Phequlula iwebhu ku-Android TV usebenzisa i-remote, ikhibhodi, noma igundane. Sebenzisa i-D-pad ukunyakaza phakathi kwezinkinobho naphakathi kwekhasi.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_2">Imodi yegundane ne-pointer</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_2">Vula imodi yegundane ukuze unyakazise i-pointer nge-D-pad bese uchofoza ngo-OK. Xhuma igundane le-USB noma le-Bluetooth noma nini — lisebenza ngokushesha.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_3">Gcina izintandokazi zakho</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_3">Sebenzisa inkinobho yenkanyezi ukubeka amakhasi kumabhukhimakhi. Vula amabhukhimakhi agciniwe nomlando kubha yamathuluzi noma nini.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_4">Konke sekulungile</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_4">Umlando ugcinwa ngokuzenzakalelayo. Vakashela Izilungiselelo ukuze ushintshe ikhasi lakho lasekhaya, uvimbe izikhangiso, noma usule idatha.</string>
